@startuml
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

title American Airlines Daily Reserve & Open Time Handoff Workflow

box "Open Time Systems" #LightBlue
participant "TTS / UBL" as TTS
end box

box "Reserve Systems" #LightYellow
participant "ROTA\n(3 PM Automated Run)" as ROTA
participant "ROTD\n(Real-Time Assignment)" as ROTD
end box

actor "Flight Attendant" as FA

== The 48-Hour Open Time & UBL Window ==
note over TTS: TTS runs nightly for trips 2+ days out.\nInside 48 hours, UBL takes over.
FA -> TTS: Submits ballots for next-day open time (UBL)
note over TTS: Auto-UBL Windows run continuously\nfrom 0400 to 1445 HBT for next-day trips.
TTS -> FA: Awards trip automatically if match found (No scheduling phone call)

== The ROTA Cutoff & Execution (1500 HBT) ==
note over TTS: Final UBL sweep finishes at 1445 HBT
ROTA -> TTS: Pulls all remaining unassigned sequences for tomorrow
FA -> ROTA: Daily reserve bids lock strictly at 1500 HBT

group ROTA Automated Processing (In Seniority Order)
    ROTA -> ROTA: 1. Awards / Assigns Sequences to Reserves
    ROTA -> ROTA: 2. Awards / Assigns Standby Shifts (OPR)
    ROTA -> ROTA: 3. Assigns Remaining Pool to RAPs
end

ROTA -> FA: Posts tomorrow's complete timeline (By 1930 HBT)

== The Live Operational Window (1501+ HBT) ==
note right of ROTD: ROTD handles late-breaking changes dynamically
TTS -> ROTD: New sequence drops into open time after 1500 ROTA run
ROTD -> ROTD: Matches trip to an available assigned RAP
ROTD -> FA: Live assignment pushed to Crew Portal (Screen alert)

== Nightly Acknowledgment Deadline (2230 HBT) ==
FA -> FA: Checks Crew Portal before bed
alt Awarded a Sequence or Standby Shift
    FA -> ROTA: Electronically Acknowledges Assignment by 2230 HBT
else Assigned a clean RAP only
    note over FA: No acknowledgment required for a basic RAP
end

@enduml
